Did you give the whole box to the robot?

Did you press 'Escape' when you were finished training the robot?

Did you train the robot to copy the box with a zero in it?

Did you take out the box with 6 zeros in and join it to the box
you just trained the robot to make?

Did you remember to put the box that now has 7 zeros back?

Did you remember to give the robot the box after training him?

Dusty tries to show up when he thinks you need him.  Did you
use him to vacuum up the box with 6 zeros from the robot's
thought bubble?

OK this one was hard.  What I would do is give the robot the box.
I'd train the robot to copy the box with the zero in and set it
down.  Then I'd take out the box with 6 zeros in it and drop it
next to the new box to join them.  Then I'd put the box back.  That's
the end of the robot's training so I'd push 'Escape'. I'd give the
trained robot the box.  I'd use Dusty to suck out the box with 6 zeros
from the robot's thought bubble.  Then I'd give the box back to the
robot and wait for him to finish.  Finally I'd pick up the box
with 10 zeros.
